<para>
  A <classname>ContinuumProfileXT</classname> object represents a
  <link
  linkend="Section-Concepts-Mesh-BoundaryCondition-Profile"><classname>Profile</classname></link>
  that varies continuously as a function of space and may also be a
  function of time.  Although the <varname>function</varname>
  parameter is a <link
  linkend="Object-ProfileFunction"><classname>ProfileFunctionX</classname></link>
  object, it may be given as a simple string.  See <link
  linkend="Object-ProfileFunction"><classname>ProfileFunction</classname></link>
  for details.
</para>

